text = "It only took three days
It started with a virus. Then it moved to the brain
People changed: aggression, loss of every human trait
The panic spread as fast as the virus
Now the streets are silent
Except for the sounds of the infected echoing through the ruins
You were supposed to leave with everyone else
But when the evacuation was raided by the zombies
You were left behind
The quarantine zone lies beyond the town
The only way out is your truck, but it won't make the journey
Not without repairs
The parts you need are scattered throughout the town and forest
But time is running out
The infection is spreading. The hordes are growing
Find the parts, repair the truck, and reach the quarantine zone
Survive!
Survive long enough to escape"
horizontal_alignment = 1
vertical_alignment = 1
